[statement]
A dependency whose operator admits earlier versions is met by a provider
at no version, as the request's entry is: `app` needs `v<3`, and apk
installs `a`, which provides `v` at no version with a priority.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v<3

P:a
V:1
k:10
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install app 1
